blocks.en:
We evaluate eight video-conditioned world models that take a source video and a target camera trajectory, divided into two groups by generation length: (1) full-length models, which render the whole clip in one pass, including InSpatio-World 1.5 [ 52 ] , World-in-World [ 44 ] , and WorldForge v2 [ 46 ] ;
and (2) frame-limited models, which produce at most 81 frames (49 for TrajectoryCrafter), including ReCamMaster [ 1 ] , CameraAnything [ 23 ] , UniWorld-View [ 70 ] , WorldForge v1 [ 45 ] , and TrajectoryCrafter [ 65 ] .
All models receive the same source video and the same action sequence.
Each action sequence is converted into per-frame camera poses relative to the source camera and passed through the model’s native conditioning interface at its native resolution and frame rate; models with a different frame rate receive the same actions resampled to their own time grid.
Frame-limited models process only the opening segment of each clip up to their maximum length (81 frames, or 49 for TrajectoryCrafter), conditioned on the corresponding prefix of the full trajectory, and are scored on that segment only.
For scoring, (1) all metrics operate on a time grid in seconds;
(2) scores are averaged over items, videos, and then models;
and (3) a dimension score is the mean of its sub-metrics, and the overall score is the equal-weight mean of the six dimensions.

blocks.zh:
我们评价了八个带视频条件的世界模型,这些模型取自源视频并取出目标相机轨迹,按代长分为两组:(1)全长模型,使整段剪辑成一行,包括InSpatio-World 1.5 [52],World-in-World [44],和WorldForge v 2 [46];
和 (2)帧限量型号,最多可出产81帧(49为TrajectryCrafter),包括ReCamMaster [1],相机Anything [23],UniWorld-View [70],WorldForge v1 [45],和TrajectryCrafter [65].
所有模型都收到相同的源视频和相同的动作序列.
每个动作序列被转换成每帧相机相对出自源相机,并按其原生分辨率和帧速率通过模型的本土调节接口;不同帧速率的模型得到相同的动作再被复制到自己的时间网格.
框架受限的模型只处理每个片段的开口部分,最大长度(81帧,或TrajectoryCrafter的49个),以整个轨迹的相应前缀为条件,只在该片段上得分.
就评分而言,(1) 所有衡量标准以秒计在时间网上运行;
(2) 物品、录像和模型的分数平均;
和(3)一个维度分数是其子度量的平均值,整体分数是六个维度的等重平均值.
